Name: Android Explicit Synchronization
URL: http://source.android.com
Description: libsync helper library.
Version: 074e053f159602aa7558cfb2ae2f3c67878d90e0
Update Mechanism: Manual
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE

Modifications:
- Added strlcpy.c
- src/ has only the upstream files Chromium builds, plus NOTICE; Android.bp,
  libsync.map.txt, OWNERS and tests/ are not imported.
- src/include/sync/sync.h is a copy of src/include/android/sync.h; upstream
  has a symlink there, which Crowbar cannot import.

To import a new snapshot of libsync:
- Copy NOTICE, sync.c, sw_sync.h, include/android/sync.h and
  include/ndk/sync.h of
  https://chromium.googlesource.com/aosp/platform/system/core/libsync at the
  new commit into src/, and include/android/sync.h to
  src/include/sync/sync.h.
- Update this README to reflect the new version.
